EN:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fruit {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}is full of vitamins, you know. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Just saying the word fruit gives me
some extra pep.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Now I feel like I 
need to eat some.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pick some {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruit {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}for me, will ya?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK!
No way!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Meyve {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}vitamin doludur, biliyorsun.
{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}“Meyve” demek bile bana enerji veriyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Şimdi canım çekti işte.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bana biraz {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}meyve {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}toplar mısın?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tamam!
Olmaz!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Um mein Training effektiver zu
machen, hab ich mir neulich einen
Ernährungsplan zusammengestellt.
Und für heute sieht dieser Plan
eine {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Frucht{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} vor. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Leider hab ich aber gerade
keine in Griffweite.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Und hier kommst du ins Spiel.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Kannst du mir irgendeine {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Frucht{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
holen, während ich weitertrainiere?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Na gut!
Hab zu tun.

IT:
OK, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi servirebbe
il tuo aiuto.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ho proprio voglia di
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
succos{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}. Chissà che sapore ha.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Questa frutta non c'è in città,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma
potresti cercarla per me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Per favore?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ci provo!
Non penso proprio.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Qué gran descubrimiento!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Dicen que hay{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruta deliciosa{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
que es una maravilla maravillosa!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Me gustan los desafíos, ¡así que
tengo que probarla al menos
una vez en la vida!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Oye, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si te encuentras por ahí algo
de {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruta deliciosa{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, ¡tráemela!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Vale!
No cuentes conmigo

IT:
Ho sentito per caso che da qualche{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
parte esiste la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutta perfetta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Pare, però, che{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sia molto rara{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}A me piacciono un sacco le cose
rare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non posso farmi sfuggire
un'occasione così!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se trovi un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutto perfetto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
portamelo!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Penso di poterlo fare!
Non voglio!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}¿Qué? ¿No vas a enrollarte?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pues nada, tendré que buscarme
la vida yo solo. Qué palo...

